    "6.2.",
    "Completing a triangulated category with silting objects.",
    "The aim of this subsection is to prove the following theorem.",
    "Proof. Let M be a silting object of C. Then by  Theorem 3.8 b) ], there exists a dg K-algebra A together with a triangle equivalence from per(A) to C taking A to M .",
    "Therefore"
